<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1367368050"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1537813250"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="S_TEAM"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Eliana (エリアンナ)"/><amll:meta key="album" value="甲鉄城のカバネリ COMPLETE SOUNDTRACK"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:59.281"><div begin="00:17.401" end="03:36.656"><p begin="00:17.401" end="00:19.706" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">いつかは捨てるtrust＆stream<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终将舍弃信与流</span></p><p begin="00:19.840" end="00:21.669" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">仮の希望像<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虚假的希望</span></p><p begin="00:23.915" end="00:26.998" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">完全なClose 高架線ごと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连高架线也完全封闭</span></p><p begin="00:27.909" end="00:32.579" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">取り替えてるような怒りと業<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愤怒与业果似在相互交替</span></p><p begin="00:32.739" end="00:35.914" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">Woh oh oh oh oh oh oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喔 哦 哦 哦 哦 哦 哦</span></p><p begin="00:36.531" end="00:40.504" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">機械的感情に飽きてるLIFE<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">生活已厌倦了机械的情感</span></p><p begin="00:40.504" end="00:43.347" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">Woh oh oh oh oh oh oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喔 哦 哦 哦 哦 哦 哦</span></p><p begin="00:44.629" end="00:47.626" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">人の所為じゃ つまらない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">推卸责任 无聊至极</span></p><p begin="00:50.741" end="00:53.885" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">Go steam ahead with your soul<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带着你的灵魂 前进吧</span></p><p begin="00:54.621" end="00:57.025" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">And scream it out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">放声呐喊</span></p><p begin="00:58.748" end="01:01.880" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">A gleam in your fervid eye<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你炽热的眼中闪烁着光芒</span></p><p begin="01:02.727" end="01:05.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">There ain't no doubt<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毫无疑问</span></p><p begin="01:06.993" end="01:07.869" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">Shoot 'em off<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">勇敢出击</span></p><p begin="01:08.426" end="01:10.040" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">What you holdin' on for?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你在犹豫什么</span></p><p begin="01:10.040" end="01:11.961" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">You're not an underdog<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你不是弱者</span></p><p begin="01:12.512" end="01:15.070" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">Keep findin' your way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继续寻找你的方向</span></p><p begin="01:15.070" end="01:15.850" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">Boost 'em up<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">燃烧激情</span></p><p begin="01:16.574" end="01:18.094" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">What you holdin' on for?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你在犹豫什么</span></p><p begin="01:18.139" end="01:20.042" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">Let's get out of control<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们尽情放纵</span></p><p begin="01:20.573" end="01:23.599" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">Keep burnin' your flame<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">保持如火的激情</span></p><p begin="01:39.997" end="01:42.876" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">Your icy heart pumps hot blood<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你冰冷的心脏将炽热的血液输送至你的全身</span></p><p begin="01:42.951" end="01:44.096" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">to your marrow,</p><p begin="01:44.096" end="01:44.412" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">Though</p><p begin="01:46.560" end="01:48.267" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">They're gettin' close to<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们即将追赶上你</span></p><p begin="01:48.576" end="01:49.395" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">what you got</p><p begin="01:50.536" end="01:51.885" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">Pursuin' and takin' all<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论你去那里 始终紧随着你 觊觎着你的一切</span></p><p begin="01:52.299" end="01:53.425" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">wherever you go</p><p begin="01:55.249" end="01:57.856" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">Woh oh oh oh oh oh oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喔 哦 哦 哦 哦 哦 哦</span></p><p begin="01:59.119" end="02:01.509" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">Your life's so breakable,<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的生命如此脆弱</span></p><p begin="02:01.692" end="02:02.916" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">I can't tell a lie<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不能说谎</span></p><p begin="02:03.180" end="02:05.915" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">Woh oh oh oh oh oh oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喔 哦 哦 哦 哦 哦 哦</span></p><p begin="02:07.257" end="02:08.109" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">To stand tall through,<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">昂首挺立冲破黑夜</span></p><p begin="02:08.235" end="02:09.888" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">just mar the night</p><p begin="02:13.233" end="02:16.604" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">Go steam ahead with your soul<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带着你的灵魂 前进吧</span></p><p begin="02:17.335" end="02:19.744" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">And scream it out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">放声呐喊</span></p><p begin="02:21.375" end="02:24.718" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">A gleam in your fervid eye<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你炽热的眼中闪烁着光芒</span></p><p begin="02:25.388" end="02:28.061" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">There ain't no doubt<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毫无疑问</span></p><p begin="02:29.644" end="02:30.588" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">Shoot 'em off<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">勇敢出击</span></p><p begin="02:31.131" end="02:32.754" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">What you holdin' on for?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你在犹豫什么</span></p><p begin="02:32.754" end="02:34.906" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">You're not an underdog<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你不是弱者</span></p><p begin="02:35.207" end="02:37.705" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">Keep findin' your way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继续寻找你的方向</span></p><p begin="02:37.705" end="02:38.644" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">Boost 'em up<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">燃烧激情</span></p><p begin="02:39.176" end="02:40.739" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">What you holdin' on for?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你在犹豫什么</span></p><p begin="02:40.777" end="02:42.830" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">Let's get out of control<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们尽情放纵</span></p><p begin="02:43.267" end="02:46.130" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">Keep burnin' your flame<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">保持如火的激情</span></p><p begin="03:03.730" end="03:06.924" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">Go steam ahead with your soul<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带着你的灵魂 前进吧</span></p><p begin="03:07.709" end="03:09.964" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">And scream it out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">放声呐喊</span></p><p begin="03:11.906" end="03:14.984" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">A gleam in your fervid eye<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你炽热的眼中闪烁着光芒</span></p><p begin="03:15.828" end="03:18.498" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">There ain't no doubt<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毫无疑问</span></p><p begin="03:20.134" end="03:21.056" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">Shoot 'em off<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">勇敢出击</span></p><p begin="03:21.630" end="03:23.084" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">What you holdin' on for?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你在犹豫什么</span></p><p begin="03:23.148" end="03:25.291" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">You're not an underdog<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你不是弱者</span></p><p begin="03:25.615" end="03:28.041" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">Keep findin' your way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继续寻找你的方向</span></p><p begin="03:28.157" end="03:29.009" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">Boost 'em up<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">燃烧激情</span></p><p begin="03:29.636" end="03:31.073" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">What you holdin' on for?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你在犹豫什么</span></p><p begin="03:31.177" end="03:33.375" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56">Let's get out of control<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们尽情放纵</span></p><p begin="03:33.661" end="03:36.656" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57">Keep burnin' your flame<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">保持如火的激情</span></p></div></body></tt>